"Any NDEF tag can be the coin: a transit card, a hotel key, a blank. The app keeps a hash of the tag, never its contents. A copied tag is the same coin — the factor is possession, like every physical key ever cut. One honesty: NFC reading needs the NFC Tag Reading capability, which only a paid developer team's profile grants — under free Personal Team signing the taps will fail, and that is the team talking, not the tag." = "どのNDEFタグもコインになれる：交通カード、ホテルの鍵、空白のもの。アプリはタグのハッシュを保持し、その内容は決して保持しない：使うとは、その存在をあなたが選んだターゲットと組にし、ケイデンスを第二要素にすること。";
"Any time." = "いつでも。";
"Any time. Genuinely." = "いつでも。本当に。";
"Anything else she builds: tools, scripts, whole programs — drafted by her minds, held here, yours to take anywhere. JavaScript runs on the spot." = "彼女が他に作るものすべて：ツール、スクリプト、プログラム丸ごと — 彼女の心が起草し、ここに保管され、あなたが撃てる。";
