"Export the library (.json)" = "ライブラリを書き出す (.json)";
"Exposure, to the decimal — the Standard's inventory: presence first, then each standing emission at its fixed weight, then the evidence, folded by its formula. Nothing is capped; a fully lit house sums to exactly 100.0." = "露出、小数まで — スタンダードの目録：まず存在、次に常設の発出を額面で、一度だけ合計 — スタンダードが滞在でなく存在の権利を気にする場所での返金を差し引く。";
