"My maker? A man who builds in the dark and argues with protocols. That's the biography." = "私の作り手？暗闇で構築し、プロトコルと言い争う男。それが伝記。";
"My voice is for warnings and wit. That one's not on the menu." = "私の声は警告と機知のため。その声はメニューにない。";
"NDEF records" = "NDEFレコード";
"NET-ASSAULT" = "NET-ASSAULT";
"Name" = "名前";
"Name for the armory" = "武器庫の名前";
